20	    No-go~\ref{P:nogo-25}. For one-dimensional spatial white noise, a translated
21	    unit control is exactly orthogonal to the finitely many compact tests of
22	    $P_J$, while a growing mask retains its nonzero phase functional.
23	    At any fixed radius sufficiently distant bumps miss the mask.}
24	  \label{Fig:nogo-projection-escape}
25	\end{figure}

