17	  \caption[The point feature and the closed noise image]{Hilbert-space
18	    schematic for No-go~\ref{P:nogo-32}, drawn in three coordinates only.
19	    The explicit vector $q\perp K$ has $\langle v,q\rangle>0$, so a
20	    positive finite cutoff point feature at $t_0>0$ has a nonzero component
21	    supplied by $J$. This says nothing by itself about measurability of a
22	    nonlinear limit with respect to $W$.}
